        "id": 5845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-17T02:29:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Was cargo culting [CPDFSimpleFontTest::BaseFontNameWithSubsetting](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/pdfium/core/fpdfapi/font/cpdf_simplefont_unittest.cpp;l\u003d46;drc\u003d75e77041a822f7ac7e73fb94b24e8c7771ff7f36). However, note that this is part of lamba that returns `RetainPtr\u003cCPDF_Font\u003e` so the gtest `ASSERT_*` doesn\u0027t work here (since it returns `void`). That being said, on inspection it appears `NewIndirect` has `new` semantics (it calls `new` eventually) and so will crash and never return `nullptr`.",
      "parentUuid": "7b9ab831_1c1289f8",
      "revId": "2def67f76c79150125c1ebfcc2febb5d07209374",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
